    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT201 · Further study</span>\n<h2>Links for further study</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Collected automatically from the syllabus, the slides and the material pack. Some may have moved since the university published them.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MKT201 · Học thêm</span>\n<h2>Link học thêm</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Gom tự động từ syllabus, slide và gói tài liệu. Một số link có thể đã đổi chỗ kể từ khi trường công bố.</p></div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.pearsonglobaleditions.com/Sitemap/Solomon/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.pearsonglobaleditions.com/Sitemap/Solomon/</a> <small>— giáo trình</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/generative-ai-prompt-engineering-for-everyone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/generative-ai-prompt-engineering-for-everyone</a> <small>— giáo trình</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/projects/prompt-engineering-generative-ai-for-marketing-advertising\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/projects/prompt-engineering-generative-ai-for-marketing-advertising</a> <small>— giáo trình</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.expertrating.com/quizzes/Materialism-Test.asp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.expertrating.com/quizzes/Materialism-Test.asp</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_02.docx, tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_05.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.benjerry.com/activism/mission-statement/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.benjerry.com/activism/mission-statement/</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_02.docx, tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_05.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.benjerry.com/company/sear/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.benjerry.com/company/sear/</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_02.docx, tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_05.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.telegraph.co.uk/science/science-news/6232801/Subliminal-advertising-really-does-work-claim-scientists.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.telegraph.co.uk/science/science-news/6232801/Subliminal-advertising-really-does-work-claim-scientists.html</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_03.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.colormatters.com/color-symbolism/gender-differences\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.colormatters.com/color-symbolism/gender-differences</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_03.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://blog.kissmetrics.com/gender-and-color/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://blog.kissmetrics.com/gender-and-color/</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_03.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.quicklabel.com/blog/2012/01/gender-targeted-packaging-9-packages-designed-to-appeal-to-men-or-women/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.quicklabel.com/blog/2012/01/gender-targeted-packaging-9-packages-designed-to-appeal-to-men-or-women/</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_03.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.businessinsider.com/15-weirdly-effective-places-to-advertise-youve-never-thought-of-2011-1?op=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.businessinsider.com/15-weirdly-effective-places-to-advertise-youve-never-thought-of-2011-1?op=1</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_03.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://smallbusiness.chron.com/five-advantages-using-celebrities-advertising-34394.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://smallbusiness.chron.com/five-advantages-using-celebrities-advertising-34394.html</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_04.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.wbiconpro.com/519-Peter.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.wbiconpro.com/519-Peter.pdf</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_04.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.fastcodesign.com/1671033/why-focus-groups-kill-innovation-from-the-designer-behind-swiffer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.fastcodesign.com/1671033/why-focus-groups-kill-innovation-from-the-designer-behind-swiffer</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_04.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://shop.vans.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://shop.vans.com</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_05.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.strategicbusinessinsights.com/vals/presurvey.shtml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.strategicbusinessinsights.com/vals/presurvey.shtml</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_05.docx, tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_07.docx, tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_12.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.burningman.com/whatisburningman/about_burningman/principles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.burningman.com/whatisburningman/about_burningman/principles.html</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_05.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zKfF40jeCA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zKfF40jeCA</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_06.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SwDEF-w4rJk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SwDEF-w4rJk</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_06.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://uk.reuters.com/article/2013/08/11/us-china-food-idUKBRE97A0DB20130811\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://uk.reuters.com/article/2013/08/11/us-china-food-idUKBRE97A0DB20130811</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_08.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.corporatewatch.org/?lid=2693\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.corporatewatch.org/?lid=2693</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_08.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.theaxeeffect.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.theaxeeffect.com</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_08.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://news.cbre.co.uk/consumers-want-convenience-and-a-social-experience-when-choosing-where-to-shop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://news.cbre.co.uk/consumers-want-convenience-and-a-social-experience-when-choosing-where-to-shop</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_10.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.auntjemimasrevenge.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.auntjemimasrevenge.blogspot.com/</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_13.docx</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://geert-hofstede.com/countries.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://geert-hofstede.com/countries.html</a> <small>— tài liệu solomon_cb12_im_14.docx</small></li>\n</ul>"
